#
# 2026-10-07, a lambda takes its functional method's parameters (override edges), arms of a switch expression start
# from the selector's facts, guards through constructor arguments and call branches of ?:: 160 files, 109 errors.
#
# 2026-10-07, maddi 1bef3fff0 (constructor type arguments follow the target's states at any depth, requireNonNull(x)
# as x!!, a type variable's override keeps E and casts its null): 169 files, 83 errors.
#
